{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n《璀璨之城》結局周不僅劇情緊張，更成全城演員演技大鬥法！張智霖憑「暗黑力量」角色挑戰從演以來最大突破，被指強勢衝擊今年視帝寶座，而江美儀亦會迎來多場「大喊大笑大癲」的爆發性場口，一眾主角演技大爆發，誓要將劇集變成「演技之城」！\n</p>\n<h2>張智霖展現暗黑力量 挑戰高難度內心戲問鼎視帝</h2>\n<p>張智霖（Chilam）在《璀璨之城》中飾演官孝賢一角，徹底顛覆以往的帥氣形象，展現出觀眾從未見過的「暗黑力量」，演技備受讚賞。在結局周，他將挑戰一場極度高難度的「內心戲」，據悉該場戲將會是Chilam從演以來的最大演技突破。憑藉這個充滿層次和張力的奸角，張智霖被外界視為今年台慶頒獎禮「最佳男主角」的大熱人選，衝擊視帝的實力絕對不容置疑。</p>\n<h2>江美儀演技再登新高度 上演大喊大笑大癲場口</h2>\n<p>另一位在劇中大晒超班演技、人氣再度急升的江美儀，在結局周亦會將演技推向另一新高度。她飾演的丁麗明因要解碼「秘密資金」而壓力爆煲，病情每況愈下，並將迎來多場「大喊大笑大癲」的高難度場口。江美儀的精湛演繹，將角色的崩潰與瘋狂狀態表現得淋漓盡致，發揮空間極大，極有機會憑此角色再度獲得演技獎項的肯定。</p>\n<h2>高海寧崩潰之巔鬥喊功 張曦雯陳瀅迎淚之對決</h2>\n<p>除了兩位主角，劇中一眾女演員的表現同樣亮眼。高海寧（高Ling）今晚將會挑戰「崩潰之巔」，演技大爆發。而在結局周，張曦雯及陳瀅亦需處理多場極之複雜的內心戲，迎來一場「淚之對決」，兩人的喊戲將會是劇集的一大看點。隨著劇情推至頂峰，《璀璨之城》極有機會憑張智霖、高海寧、張曦雯、江美儀及陳瀅，擸盡年底頒獎禮各大演技獎項。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚演技之城：「今年視帝視后實係佢哋！」</h2>\n<p>一眾演員在結局周的演技大爆發，引來網民一面倒激讚，更封劇集為「演技之城」。網民紛紛留言力撐心水演員：「Chilam今次真係奸到出汁，完全唔同以前，視帝冇得輸！」、「江美儀啲戲真係冇得頂，睇到我起雞皮！」、「高Ling、張曦雯、陳瀅個個都做得好好，女主角獎競爭好激烈！」、「《璀璨之城》應該改名叫《演技之城》，個個都係好戲之人！」、「頒獎禮唔使諗啦，最佳劇集、男女主角、配角全部都係《璀璨》嘅！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14a_4835835086ae80419936f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14a_4835835086ae80419936f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_15419698456ae8041c89615.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_15419698456ae8041c89615.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15a_1896851446ae8041f682f9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15a_1896851446ae8041f682f9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_16681733256ae80422b4b34.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_16681733256ae80422b4b34.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_17763410246ae8043e71acc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_17763410246ae8043e71acc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_857714936ae804416c2f5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_857714936ae804416c2f5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:21:03.676396+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1159,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:00:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:38:51.542769+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:21.510625+00:00","content_hash":"f8553bb8d600a6ca8b35ccfef836cf89da9cceaa30657cecff8b37229ed3a3da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}